  "title": "Tradeweb Reports July 2026 Total Trading Volume of $67.5 Trillion and Average Daily Volume of $2.9 Trillion",
  "summary": "NEW YORK – August 6, 2026 – Tradeweb Markets Inc. (Nasdaq: TW), a global leader in electronic trading across asset classes, today reported total trading volume for the month of July 2026 of $67.5 trillion (tn). Average daily volume (\"ADV\") for the month was $2.9tn, an increase of 23.3 percent (%) year-over-year (\"YoY\").",
